{"seq":1,"slug":"double-layer","title":"双电层与界面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/kinetics/double-layer","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"双电层与界面\">双电层与界面</h1><p>把一片金属浸入电解液，肉眼看不出任何变化，但在金属与溶液接触的那薄薄一层——大约只有一两个纳米厚——发生着电化学里最关键的事情。金属表面带上电荷，溶液一侧的离子被静电吸引过来排成一层，整个界面像一个被充了电的微型电容器。所有的电极反应都必须穿过这个界面发生，所以理解双电层的结构，是理解动力学与极化的前提。本篇专门讲清这个界面长什么样、电势在其中如何分布、又为何表现得像电容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当电极电势与溶液不一致时，电荷会在界面两侧分离：金属一侧出现过剩的电子或正电荷，溶液一侧则聚集等量异号离子。这一层正负电荷相对排列的结构，就是电化学双电层（electric double layer，EDL）。它不是化学键，而是静电平衡的产物，厚度仅纳米量级，却承担了电极与溶液之间几乎全部的电势降。</p>\n<p>对双电层结构的认识经历了三代模型的演进，每一代都修正了前一代的不足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[电极带电] --&gt; B[Helmholtz模型&lt;br/&gt;离子紧贴电极排一层]&#10;  B --&gt; C[问题:忽略热运动]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Gouy-Chapman模型&lt;br/&gt;扩散分布的离子云]&#10;  D --&gt; E[问题:点电荷贴太近]&#10;  E --&gt; F[Stern模型&lt;br/&gt;紧密层+扩散层]&#10;  F --&gt; G[现代图像&lt;br/&gt;IHP/OHP + 扩散层]\">flowchart TD\n  A[电极带电] --&gt; B[Helmholtz模型&lt;br/&gt;离子紧贴电极排一层]\n  B --&gt; C[问题:忽略热运动]\n  C --&gt; D[Gouy-Chapman模型&lt;br/&gt;扩散分布的离子云]\n  D --&gt; E[问题:点电荷贴太近]\n  E --&gt; F[Stern模型&lt;br/&gt;紧密层+扩散层]\n  F --&gt; G[现代图像&lt;br/&gt;IHP/OHP + 扩散层]</pre><p>下表对比三代模型的核心假设与局限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>提出年代</th>\n<th>核心图像</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Helmholtz</td>\n<td>1853</td>\n<td>离子紧贴电极排成单层，像平板电容器</td>\n<td>忽略离子热运动与浓度影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gouy-Chapman</td>\n<td>1910s</td>\n<td>离子呈扩散分布的「离子云」</td>\n<td>把离子当点电荷，预测电容过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stern</td>\n<td>1924</td>\n<td>紧密层（Helmholtz）+ 扩散层（Gouy-Chapman）串联</td>\n<td>仍简化了离子特性吸附</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"紧密层-内外亥姆霍兹面\">紧密层：内外亥姆霍兹面</h2><p>Stern 模型把双电层分成两段串联的结构，靠近电极的一段叫紧密层（也称 Stern 层或亥姆霍兹层）。这里的离子受静电力和特性吸附力束缚，排列相对有序。紧密层里又区分两个特征面：内亥姆霍兹面（IHP）是脱去部分溶剂化壳、直接吸附到电极上的离子中心所在平面；外亥姆霍兹面（OHP）则是仍带完整溶剂化壳、靠静电吸引而最接近电极的离子中心所在平面。</p>\n<p>紧密层的电势随距离近似线性下降，行为很像一个固定间距的平板电容器。它的存在解释了为什么电极反应的难易不仅取决于电势，还取决于哪些离子、以什么方式吸附在表面——这正是催化与析氢、析氧反应活性差异的微观根源，会在 <a href=\"electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 中具体讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩散层-离子云与德拜长度\">扩散层：离子云与德拜长度</h2><p>OHP 之外是扩散层，离子在这里同时受静电吸引与热运动扰动，浓度随距电极的距离按指数衰减，逐渐过渡到本体溶液的均匀浓度。扩散层的特征厚度由德拜长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ε</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa^{-1} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\varepsilon\\varepsilon_0 RT}{2F^2 I_c}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.844em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.596em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.556em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.844em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是离子强度。这个公式揭示一条重要规律：电解质浓度越高，德拜长度越短，扩散层被压得越薄。在 0.1 mol/L 的水溶液中德拜长度约 1 nm，而在锂电池那种数 mol/L 的浓电解液里，扩散层几乎被压缩殆尽，双电层退化为近乎纯紧密层结构。这种「浓溶液压缩扩散层」的效应，与 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 里强调的「高浓度须用活度」是同一物理现象的两个侧面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把界面当电容器-微分电容\">把界面当电容器：微分电容</h2><p>双电层的电容性质可以直接测量。定义微分电容为单位电极面积上电荷对电势的变化率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_d = \\frac{\\partial \\sigma}{\\partial E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实验测得的微分电容典型值在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\sim40\\,\\mu\\mathrm{F/cm^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级。把这个数字乘以巨大的比表面积，就得到了惊人的电荷存储能力——这正是超级电容器的工作原理。一块多孔碳电极的比表面积可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\sim2000\\,\\mathrm{m^2/g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">/g</span></span></span></span></span></span>，纯靠双电层储能就能达到法拉级电容，相关器件见 <a href=\"../batteries/fuel-cell-supercap\">燃料电池与超级电容</a>。</p>\n<p>微分电容随电势变化的曲线（电容-电势曲线）还能反推零电荷电势（PZC）——电极表面净电荷为零的特定电势，是研究界面吸附的重要参照点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双电层为何决定一切电极过程\">双电层为何决定一切电极过程</h2><p>双电层的核心地位在于：任何电极反应的电子转移，都发生在这个纳米尺度的界面里，电子必须从电极穿过界面到达反应物（或反之）。界面上的电势分布决定了反应物所感受到的「有效电场」，进而决定反应速率。当外加电势改变时，首先要给双电层「充电」（充电电流，即非法拉第电流），之后才驱动真正的电荷转移反应（法拉第电流）。这两种电流的区分，是所有电化学测量与分析技术必须处理的基本问题，会在 <a href=\"../applications/electroanalytical\">电化学分析方法</a> 中再次出现。</p>\n<p>正因为双电层把电势降集中在纳米尺度内，界面处的电场强度可高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7\\,\\mathrm{V/cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">V/cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，远超本体溶液——这种极端电场正是电极能催化常温下难以发生反应的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双电层是电极与溶液界面处正负电荷相对排列的纳米级结构，承担电极-溶液间几乎全部电势降。</li>\n<li>模型从 Helmholtz（平板电容）到 Gouy-Chapman（扩散离子云）再到 Stern（紧密层+扩散层）逐步精化。</li>\n<li>紧密层含内/外亥姆霍兹面，电势近似线性下降；离子特性吸附在此发生，影响反应活性。</li>\n<li>扩散层厚度由德拜长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定，浓度越高扩散层越薄，与「高浓度须用活度」同源。</li>\n<li>界面微分电容达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\sim40\\,\\mu\\mathrm{F/cm^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，乘以大比表面积即超级电容储能原理；充电电流与法拉第电流的区分贯穿所有电化学测量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"双电层与界面","id":"双电层与界面"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"紧密层：内外亥姆霍兹面","id":"紧密层-内外亥姆霍兹面"},{"level":2,"text":"扩散层：离子云与德拜长度","id":"扩散层-离子云与德拜长度"},{"level":2,"text":"把界面当电容器：微分电容","id":"把界面当电容器-微分电容"},{"level":2,"text":"双电层为何决定一切电极过程","id":"双电层为何决定一切电极过程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电化学池与法拉第定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/fundamentals/cells-faraday"},"next":{"title":"电极反应动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/kinetics/electrode-kinetics"}}